  "title": "Spicy Garlicky Beef Marinade",
  "description": "This wonderful marinade uses spicy jalapenos, olive oil, elephant garlic, and fresh cilantro! This is good for carne asada and makes enough marinade for approximately 2 lbs of meat.",
